Delegates to the existing `Mesg::IsFieldValid(253)` helper, so the field lookup and validity check occur inside a single out-of-line call (where the search can be inlined) instead of issuing separate `GetField` and `IsValueValid` calls from the caller.

```cpp
    FIT_BOOL IsTimestampValid() const
    {
        return IsFieldValid(253);
    }
```